selimirror — 0.1.0
Implementation/adaptation date: 2026-10-18

This project ports the SELinux query-view behavior of ReSukiSU (now BakaSU)
to a standalone KernelPatch module for the pinned Xiaomi MIUI 4.14 kernel.
It is an independent development deliverable, not an official release of
ReSukiSU, BakaSU, KernelPatch, Xiaomi, or Kam.

